#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/cmake.rst:2
#: 3d6e9affa30b41bca9c728aa604144db
msgid "CMake targets"
msgstr "CMake 目标"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/cmake.rst:4
#: fcbc166913b241ed8415a85930c67fcd
msgid ""
"``CMakeLists.txt`` reads the package name, language standards, and build "
"switches from ``metadata.json``. It collects public headers from "
"``include/`` and implementation files from ``src/``. The scan is scoped to "
"those directories, so tests and examples do not become library sources."
msgstr ""
"``CMakeLists.txt`` 从 ``metadata.json`` 读取包名、语言标准和构建开关。它只收集 ``include/`` "
"下的公开头文件及 ``src/`` 下的实现文件，测试与示例不会混入库源码。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/cmake.rst:10
#: 77cec8950cc04f5d9cdc3e119bd99698
msgid "Targets installed for consumers"
msgstr "供使用方链接的目标"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/cmake.rst:12
#: fcbfe9b52f2e41d79f307116a013f773
msgid ""
"The regular build creates ``food3d_im_c`` and "
"``food3d_im_cpp`` plus an interface target, "
"``food3d_im``, that links both. The current project has no C "
"implementation files; the C target is kept for the template's C/C++ package "
"layout. The measurement API is C++ and lives in ``measurement.hpp`` and "
"``types.hpp``."
msgstr ""
"常规构建生成 ``food3d_im_c``、``food3d_im_cpp``，以及链接两者的接口目标 "
"``food3d_im``。当前项目没有 C 实现文件；保留 C 目标是为了兼容模板的 C/C++ 包布局。测量接口为 "
"C++，声明在 ``measurement.hpp`` 和 ``types.hpp`` 中。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/cmake.rst:17
#: f08409ee5905404983a8cf312c7ad3de
msgid "An installed consumer can use the exported target:"
msgstr "安装后的使用方可链接导出的目标："

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/cmake.rst:24
#: 47fd2a947ddc4fe2aa2bced2acbc88fd
msgid ""
"The Conan toolchain supplies the dependency locations. The CMake "
"configuration expects ``C_DEPS`` and ``CPP_DEPS`` in the ``Pkg@Target`` form"
" generated by the recipe; invoking the root CMake project without that setup"
" requires providing equivalent dependency settings."
msgstr ""
"Conan toolchain 提供依赖位置。CMake 配置还需要配方生成的 ``C_DEPS`` 与 ``CPP_DEPS``，格式为 "
"``Pkg@Target``；如果不通过 Conan 配置根项目，需自行提供等价的依赖设置。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/cmake.rst:29
#: 5792ca397991437c88b62ef14ef4b0a6
msgid "Optional outputs"
msgstr "可选构建产物"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/components/cmake.rst:31
#: 2d2825ab74024252b1ec3e40b612502b
msgid ""
"The default C++ standard is 17. C++ module compilation is considered only "
"with C++23 or newer. A host build with ``enable_python_bindings`` enabled "
"also installs the ``food3d_im_python`` module; a cross build skips"
" it. On Windows, a requested shared-library build falls back to static with "
"a warning. See :doc:`project metadata <meta>` for the switches that control "
"these choices."
msgstr ""
"默认 C++ 标准是 17；只有使用 C++23 或更高版本时才考虑编译模块。启用 ``enable_python_bindings`` "
"的主机构建还会安装 ``food3d_im_python`` 模块，交叉构建则跳过。Windows "
"上请求共享库时会警告并退回静态库。控制这些行为的开关见 :doc:`项目元数据 <meta>`。"

